  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Development for Increased Employability Programme (SDEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The programme interventions will focus on improving the quality of skills and increasing private sector participation in skills development. The programme has three specific objectives as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;SO 1&lt;/strong&gt;: Relevance &amp;amp; capacity of the TEVET system to contribute to economic diversification is enhanced;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 2&lt;/strong&gt;: Private sector access to relevant skills in selected strategic/priority sectors is improved;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SO 3&lt;/strong&gt;: Curricula are reviewed, updated and piloted to respond to labour market demands, and;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
